{"id":"650347","name":"凉拌贡菜","author":"草莓","authorId":"19344","desc":"","cover":"images/650347/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"贡菜","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"大蒜","amount":"30g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"贡菜提前泡发好。","img":"images/650347/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把贡菜切长段，沥干水分。","img":"images/650347/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中加水烧开，加水一勺盐和一勺油。","img":"images/650347/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把贡菜倒入锅中煮两分钟。","img":"images/650347/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮好的贡菜沥干水分，再用冷水冲几遍。","img":"images/650347/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"贡菜中加入大蒜碎，辣椒粉。","img":"images/650347/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋上适量热油。","img":"images/650347/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入一勺盐。","img":"images/650347/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入一勺生抽。","img":"images/650347/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入一勺白砂糖。","img":"images/650347/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入两勺凉拌香醋。","img":"images/650347/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"所有材料搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/650347/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"贡菜不用煮太久，太久影响色泽。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}